# Outfit head (R18): gas mask over the face, two glowing eye lenses and a steel filter can on the snout.
# Head frame as outfit_goggles (the head fills x 1..6, y 1..5, z 0..5).
name outfit_gasmask
grid 5
size 9 6 4
slot mask SwatchMain
slot strap SwatchAccent
slot lens SwatchGlow
slot can Steel
box 6 1 0 7 5 4 mask
box 7 2 0 8 4 2 mask
box 8 2 0 9 4 2 can
box 6 1 2 7 2 3 lens
box 6 4 2 7 5 3 lens
box 0 1 2 1 5 3 strap
box 1 0 2 6 1 3 strap
box 1 5 2 6 6 3 strap
pivot 3 3 0
